                                                "example_id": "dfdc1401-150e-4d3e-aef6-7346909c440a",
                                                "sense_id": "0e5acbcc-18c9-3a96-8271-35a6c9d0bc09",
                                                "text": "With companies wanting internet addresses that communicate they are at the forefront of the A.I. boom — like Elon Musk’s X.ai website for his artificial intelligence company — Anguilla has recently received a huge influx in requests for domain names."
                                            }
